# Keep secrets, data and dev-only trees out of the build context (and so out of the image).
.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
frontend/dist
backend/.env*
!backend/.env.example
.env
.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
notebooks
data
backend/eval
backend/tests
docs
*.dump
